{
  "title": "2026年10月13日 A 股收盘一页报告",
  "dataAsOf": "2026-10-13",
  "evidence": "Existing a-share-data and external-search case cache; presentation-only revision.",
  "html": "<style>\n.veya-report{width:100%;font:14px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--sv-text-primary)}\n.veya-report *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.veya-report :is(h1,h2,h3,p){margin:0}.veya-report h1{font-size:clamp(21px,2.5vw,28px);line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.025em}.veya-report h2{font-size:18px;line-height:1.45}.veya-report h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}.veya-report .card{background:var(--sv-surface-primary);border:1px solid var(--sv-border-subtle);border-radius:16px}.veya-report .muted{color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary);letter-spacing:.04em}.veya-report .up{color:var(--sv-price-up)}.veya-report .down{color:var(--sv-price-down)}.veya-report .flat{color:var(--sv-price-flat)}.veya-report .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.veya-report .chip{font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--sv-border-subtle);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px}.veya-report .table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}.veya-report table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.veya-report :is(th,td){padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sv-border-subtle);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.veya-report :is(th,td):first-child{text-align:left;padding-right:12px}.veya-report tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.veya-report th{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .breadth{display:flex;height:24px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px}.veya-report .breadth span{flex-shrink:0}.veya-report .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:3px;margin:0 6px 3px 0;border-radius:2px}.veya-report .stat-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .stat-value{font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.veya-report .stat-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .insight{display:grid;gap:8px}.veya-report .bar-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:68px minmax(0,1fr) 60px;gap:8px;align-items:center;min-height:36px;font-size:12px}.veya-report .bar-track{height:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:transparent}.veya-report .bar-half{position:relative}.veya-report .bar-half:first-child{border-right:1px solid var(--sv-border-subtle)}.veya-report .bar-fill{position:absolute;height:100%;top:0}.veya-report .bar-fill.positive{left:0;background:var(--sv-price-up);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0}.veya-report .bar-fill.negative{right:0;background:var(--sv-price-down);border-radius:3px 0 0 3px}.veya-report .bar-value{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.veya-report .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,150px),1fr));gap:16px}.veya-report .flow-step{display:grid;gap:8px;border-left:2px solid var(--sv-chart-series-1);padding-left:12px}.veya-report .flow-step small{font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .source-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.veya-report a{color:var(--sv-chart-series-1);text-decoration:none}.veya-report details summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}.veya-report .sources{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 16px;margin-top:8px}.veya-report .section-summary{font-size:13px;color:var(--sv-text-secondary)}\n</style><article class=\"veya-report\" data-financial-market=\"CN\" data-sv-layout=\"stack\">\n<header class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A 股收盘复盘 · 2026-10-13（北京时间）</p><h1>指数分化，个股温和偏强：<br>市场宽度好于指数表现</h1><p class=\"muted\">上证微涨，深证与创业板指小幅收跌；但全市场 2909 家上涨、2485 家下跌，个股涨跌幅中位数为 +0.16%。成交回暖至约 1.69 万亿元，板块间仍有明显分化。</p><div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">上涨家数占比 52.3%</span><span class=\"chip\">较前一交易日放量约 1380 亿元</span><span class=\"chip\">科创板、北交所中位数收负</span></div></header>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>指数对照 · 收盘</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">指数与个股体感分化：沪指微涨，深证成指与创业板指收跌。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table aria-label=\"主要指数收盘点位与涨跌幅\"><thead><tr><th>指数</th><th>收盘点位</th><th>当日涨跌幅</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>上证指数</td><td>3,800.86</td><td class=\"up\"><b>+0.10%</b></td></tr><tr><td>深证成指</td><td>12,353.70</td><td class=\"down\"><b>−0.25%</b></td></tr><tr><td>创业板指</td><td>2,958.34</td><td class=\"down\"><b>−0.18%</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"source-note\">指数点位来自公开行情与媒体复盘交叉核对；非交易所接口直取。Yahoo 指数接口限流，本页不以近似标的替代指数走势图。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>市场宽度 · 上涨家数略占优势</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">5560 只有效样本中，上涨比下跌多 424 家；家数占优不代表每只股票都上涨。</p><div class=\"breadth\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"上涨2909家52.32%，平盘166家2.99%，下跌2485家44.69%\"><span style=\"width:52.32014388%;background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></span><span style=\"width:2.98561151%;background:var(--sv-price-flat)\"></span><span style=\"width:44.69424460%;background:var(--sv-price-down)\"></span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></i>上涨 2909 家 · 52.32%</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--sv-price-flat)\"></i>平盘 166 家 · 2.99%</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--sv-price-down)\"></i>下跌 2485 家 · 44.69%</span></div><div class=\"metrics\"><div class=\"insight\"><span class=\"stat-label\">涨跌家数比</span><strong class=\"stat-value\">1.17</strong><span class=\"stat-note\">净上涨 +424 家</span></div><div class=\"insight\"><span class=\"stat-label\">个股涨跌幅中位数</span><strong class=\"stat-value up\">+0.16%</strong><span class=\"stat-note\">逐股快照自算</span></div><div class=\"insight\"><span class=\"stat-label\">全市场成交额</span><strong class=\"stat-value\">1.69 万亿</strong><span class=\"stat-note\">沪深京自算 16889 亿元</span></div><div class=\"insight\"><span class=\"stat-label\">涨停 / 跌停</span><strong class=\"stat-value\">70 / 10</strong><span class=\"stat-note\">媒体复盘口径</span></div></div></section>\n<div data-sv-layout=\"grid\" style=\"align-items:start\"><section class=\"card\"><h2>板块分化 · 创业板个股更强</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">对照各板块个股涨跌幅中位数；与市值加权指数的口径不同。</p><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"创业板+0.44%，深市主板+0.27%，沪市主板+0.17%，科创板−0.39%，北交所−0.60%\"><div class=\"bar-row\"><span>创业板</span><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-half\"></div><div class=\"bar-half\"><span class=\"bar-fill positive\" style=\"width:73.33%\"></span></div></div><b class=\"bar-value up\">+0.44%</b></div><div class=\"bar-row\"><span>深市主板</span><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-half\"></div><div class=\"bar-half\"><span class=\"bar-fill positive\" style=\"width:45.00%\"></span></div></div><b class=\"bar-value up\">+0.27%</b></div><div class=\"bar-row\"><span>沪市主板</span><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-half\"></div><div class=\"bar-half\"><span class=\"bar-fill positive\" style=\"width:28.33%\"></span></div></div><b class=\"bar-value up\">+0.17%</b></div><div class=\"bar-row\"><span>科创板</span><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-half\"><span class=\"bar-fill negative\" style=\"width:65.00%\"></span></div><div class=\"bar-half\"></div></div><b class=\"bar-value down\">-0.39%</b></div><div class=\"bar-row\"><span>北交所</span><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-half\"><span class=\"bar-fill negative\" style=\"width:100.00%\"></span></div><div class=\"bar-half\"></div></div><b class=\"bar-value down\">-0.60%</b></div></div><p class=\"source-note\">创业板上涨占比 59.1%；科创板 41.3%，北交所 33.8%。图形以零轴为中心，左右长度同一比例。</p></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>行业强弱 · 军工与通信领先</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">申万一级行业，机构复盘口径。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table aria-label=\"主要领涨领跌行业\"><tbody><tr><td>国防军工</td><td class=\"up\">+2.69%</td></tr><tr><td>通信</td><td class=\"up\">+1.78%</td></tr><tr><td>综合</td><td class=\"up\">+1.46%</td></tr><tr><td>非银金融</td><td class=\"down\">−0.98%</td></tr><tr><td>汽车</td><td class=\"down\">−0.99%</td></tr><tr><td>电力设备</td><td class=\"down\">−2.01%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"source-note\">行业数据来自二手复盘，非交易所直连；用于呈现结构差异。</p></section></div>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>活跃个股 · 成交热度与涨跌并不同步</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">中际旭创、新易盛、天孚通信成交活跃；宁德时代与长鑫科技放量收跌。高成交额不能直接解读为净流入。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table aria-label=\"活跃个股成交与表现\"><thead><tr><th>个股</th><th>成交额（亿元）</th><th>当日表现</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>中际旭创</td><td>221.1</td><td>走强</td></tr><tr><td>新易盛</td><td>146.1</td><td>走强</td></tr><tr><td>宁德时代</td><td>119.1</td><td class=\"down\">−3.11%</td></tr><tr><td>长鑫科技</td><td>110.7</td><td class=\"down\">−2.79%</td></tr><tr><td>天孚通信</td><td>99.4</td><td class=\"up\">+7.48%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"source-note\">取自成交额前八的代表个股，剔除北交所与上市首日新股；不构成完整排名。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>接下来观察什么</h2><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"flow-step\"><h3>量价能否配合</h3><small>成交放量但指数未明显突破，关注活跃度能否延续以及权重股表现。</small></div><div class=\"flow-step\"><h3>强势能否扩散</h3><small>观察科创板、北交所的市场宽度能否改善，而非仅追踪单一热门方向。</small></div><div class=\"flow-step\"><h3>业绩能否验证</h3><small>算力与光模块链条成交活跃，后续三季报将提供新的基本面证据。</small></div></div></section>\n<footer class=\"card\"><h2>数据与口径</h2><p class=\"source-note\">本案例为 2026-10-13 收盘缓存，不随“今天”自动更新。全市场快照抓取于当日 19:19，覆盖沪深京 5580 只股票，剔除 20 只停牌或无报价标的，有效样本 5560 只。涨跌家数、板块中位数与成交额由逐股快照计算；指数、行业与涨跌停来自公开复盘。媒体下跌家数 2486 与自算 2485 存在一家的口径差异。沪深两市交易所成交额为 16759.08 亿元，与本页沪深京口径不同。</p><p class=\"source-note\">北向净买入已不再按原机制公布；仅可核验成交总额 2618.83 亿元，成交额不等于净流入。没有可靠指数时序数据，因此不绘制推测走势。以上为行情复盘与数据解读。</p><details><summary>查看缓存分析的公开来源（8 项）</summary><div class=\"sources\"><a href=\"https://quote.eastmoney.com/zs000001.html?jump_to_web=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">东方财富行情页摘要</a><a href=\"https://www.mrjjxw.com/articles/2026-10-13/4602950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">每经/每日经济新闻网复盘</a><a href=\"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15184767.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">界面转引博时市场点评</a><a href=\"http://finance.ce.cn/stock/gsgdbd/202610/t20261013_3256493.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">中国经济网 2026-10-13</a><a href=\"https://stock.stockstar.com/IG2026101300025144.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">证券之星/智通财经 2026-10-13</a><a href=\"https://gu.sina.cn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">新浪财经 2026-10-13</a><a href=\"https://data.eastmoney.com/hsgtcg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">东方财富沪深港通数据，数据日期 2026-10-13</a><a href=\"https://www.cnr.cn/jingji/cjtt/yw/20261013/t20261013_527840414.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">央广网</a></div></details></footer>\n</article>"
